  "prefLabel": "Mtec 201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 201.01 Purpose. These rules set forth how the board conducts proceedings to reach decisions on matters within its statutory jurisdiction. These rules shall be construed to secure the just, efficient and accurate resolution of such proceedings.\n\nSource. #11091-A, eff 5-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mtec200.html"
